/* 激活页（v5「字重」稿 C1 / C2 / C3）：整屏纵向 flex——顶栏 + 内容 + 底部操作区（贴底，主键 48 高）。 */
page {
  background: var(--v5-canvas);
  color: var(--v5-ink);
}
.wl {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

/* 顶栏：44 高，左返回小键（32×30，44 热区），右 104 让微信胶囊 */
.wl-nav {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  height: 44px;
  padding-left: 10px;
  padding-right: 104px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 4px;
  box-sizing: content-box;
}
.wl-hit {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}
/* 按下态挂在 44 热区上（按热区任意处键帽都下沉·同 v5-nav .nv-hit-down） */
.wl-hit-down .wl-back {
  transform: translateY(1px);
  background: var(--v5-press);
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12), 0 0 0 1px var(--v5-hair);
}
.wl-back {
  width: 32px;
  height: 30px;
  padding: 0;
}
.wl-nav-t {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}

.wl-body {
  flex: 1;
}
.wl-head {
  padding: 8px 16px 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-head-tight {
  padding-top: 4px;
}
.wl-h1 {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

/* 激活码凹槽（输入 / 结果屏回显） */
.wl-code {
  display: block;
  margin: 24px 16px 0;
  width: auto;
  height: 52px;
  line-height: 52px;
  padding: 0 16px;
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--v5-ink);
}
.wl-code-ro {
  margin-top: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  white-space: nowrap;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
.wl-code-invalid,
.wl-code-taken {
  box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14), 0 0 0 1.5px var(--v5-err);
}

/* 状态灯 + 说明 */
.wl-msg {
  padding: 12px 16px 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-msg-led {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  margin-top: 4px;
  line-height: 0;
}
.wl-msg-t {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.wl-msg-mine {
  color: var(--v5-ok-text);
}
.wl-msg-error {
  color: var(--v5-warn-text);
}
.wl-msg-bad {
  color: var(--v5-err-text);
}

/* W1：主图 + 上下渐隐。高＝屏宽和 45% 屏高取小（UI 审查 6 问 1c：SE 上 300、大屏≈380）；渐隐按 % 随高度走 */
.wl-hero {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: min(100vw, 45vh);
  overflow: hidden;
  background: var(--v5-sunk);
}
.wl-hero-img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}
.wl-fade-t {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  top: 0;
  height: 12%;
  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(250, 250, 248, 0), var(--v5-canvas));
}
.wl-fade-b {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  height: 16%;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(250, 250, 248, 0), var(--v5-canvas) 88%);
}
.wl-ok {
  padding: 4px 16px 16px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-ok-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-h0 {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 30px;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  line-height: 1.2;
}
.wl-meta {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}
.wl-lead {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}

/* W2：三件事（发丝线分隔，等宽序号） */
.wl-list {
  margin: 16px 16px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--v5-hair);
}
.wl-item {
  padding: 16px 0;
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--v5-hair);
}
.wl-no {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 24px;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}
.wl-item-tx {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}
.wl-item-h {
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 24px;
}
.wl-item-p {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--v5-ink-2);
}

/* W1「下一步」固定贴底（UI 审查 6 问 1c：唯一前进键任何屏都看得见、与开课须知同位）；占位同高防遮内容 */
.wl-dock-fix {
  position: fixed;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: var(--v5-canvas);
}
.wl-dock-space {
  height: calc(60px + max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom)));
}
/* 底部操作区：贴底，次 1 : 主 1.6，底留 max(28px, 安全区) */
.wl-dock {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  padding: 12px 16px max(28px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-dock-col {
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
}
.wl-row {
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-alt {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}
.wl-main {
  flex: 1.6;
  min-width: 0;
}
.wl-warn {
  padding: 0 2px 8px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
}
.wl-warn-t {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--v5-warn-text);
}
